                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is *really* pretty! I've got something like 178 VR titles in my Steam library, and the graphics and enviornments in this one were still enough to make me say \"Woah!\" outloud.\n\nIt feels almost like I'm standing inside the game 'Journey' (graphics-wise), and that feels *amazing!*\n\nThe gameplay is active, addictive, and feels *very* distinct from other 'punching games' like Audiosheild, Bitslap, or Thrill of the Fight. \n\nI'm breathing pretty hard after my first few rounds, and I expect I'll be playing this a *lot* in the future!\n\nOne note: I was a little confused at first, because it seemed like sometimes I was punching enemies, and it wasn't killing them... And then I realized you need to punch them in the red 'eye' to kill them, and things got a lot more satisfying afterward.",
